1/3139/313903/蝴蝶-1技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3139/313903/蝴蝶-1技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3139/313903/蝴蝶-2技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3139/313903/蝴蝶-2技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3139/313903/蝴蝶-大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3139/313903/蝴蝶-大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3139/313903/蝴蝶-入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3139/313903/蝴蝶-入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">大提琴手悄然进入了队伍之中，比其他人稍晚，但也不算引人注目。她对乐手们微笑，轻声解释自己刚才在做最后的试音。毕竟，这是他们在这座音乐厅的第一场演出，她的琴还在适应这儿的湿度，以及清水混凝土天穹下多层次的共鸣。<br />灯光暗下，乐队走向舞台。她的裙摆在行走时发出沙沙声，这声响随即被欢迎的掌声漫过。她抬起头，向第二间包厢致意。<br />极高的水泥穹顶层层叠叠。大提琴的乐声响起，稳定地托住乐队的和声，在无装饰的硬质墙面上均匀地回响——某种神秘学植物最“喜爱”这种旋律，而它的粉末将与验毒的秘银勺产生反应。那只秘银勺被一位特别惜命的目标所使用，十五日前，他可靠的药剂师添置了这只新勺子。<br />乐音齐奏之时，无人听到包厢中最后一声喘息——来自即将停止发声的喉咙。<br />一场令人满意的演出，一次完美的音乐厅潜入行动，至此完美落幕。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"313903\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-313904.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/7d/Belonging-313904.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“触角”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Antenna</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />3<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>颇具分量的金属饰品，镶嵌着宝石，末端微微颤动，如同昆虫的触角。笔者了解到，受访者亲自参与了这件发饰的设计。<br />“感知环境、传递信息，甚至追踪目标？不，这只是以弦轴为灵感的装饰品。”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-313905.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/5d/Belonging-313905.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">致命乐器<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Deadly Cello</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>造型独特的大提琴及琴弓。就像每一位爱惜乐器的音乐家，受访者十分珍视它们。<br />笔者接受了受访者即兴表演的提议，那深沉、厚重的音色令人心醉神迷。“一点小小的演奏技巧”，受访者微笑着收起琴弓，“这件乐器很美，想要试试吗？”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-313906.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a8/Belonging-313906.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“一串音符”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"A String of Notes\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />4<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一串音符，一段旋律。与发饰使用的金属材质相同，恰到好处地点缀着受访者的礼服。<br />光滑、冰凉，如蝴蝶振翅般轻柔。当生命与演奏一同落幕时，她的目标感知到的也仅此而已。</div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"全新语音\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.85.A8.E6.96.B0.E8.AF.AD.E9.9F.B3_New_Voice\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"全新语音_New_Voice\">全新语音<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">New Voice</span></small></span></h2><div><table class=\"wikitable responsive voice-table zh-only\" style=\"margin:0; --size: 23px; width:100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"hide-m\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><td style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Tupo xindiantu.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/107px-Tupo_xindiantu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"107\" height=\"30\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/161px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/214px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"740\" data-file-height=\"208\" /></td><th>EN</th><th>中</th><th class=\"not-zh\">日</th><th class=\"not-zh\">한</th><th>文本</th></tr><tr><th>入队</th><td><span class=\"hide-pc\">EN </span><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"En_play_hero313903_fightingvoc_55.mp3\" title=\"play_hero313903_fightingvoc_55\"></i><i class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"margin:10px;